cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MTDB: Multi-Timescale Dynamical Base"
message: "If you use this software or build on the architecture, please cite the repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "cndichengyu"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
url: "https://github.com/cndichengyu/mtdb"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cndichengyu/mtdb"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AGI
  - multi-timescale dynamics
  - reservoir computing
  - neuromorphic computing
  - local learning
  - predictive coding
  - phase synchronization
  - continual learning
  - active inference
abstract: >-
  A non-Transformer training substrate for the sensorimotor-intuition-memory
  layer of hybrid AGI systems: multi-timescale sparse dynamics, Kuramoto phase
  routing, working/attractor memory, three-factor local plasticity, sleep
  replay consolidation, a compressed interface for upper-layer world models,
  and an active-inference layer that chooses its own observations by expected
  free energy rather than passively predicting the next token, with multi-seed
  benchmarking, calibration/conformal uncertainty and fair Transformer baselines.
